226 0 obj
  << /ActualText (I \057 We \056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056 \050Name as appears on the title deed\051 of \n\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056 in Kenya being the proprietor of the land compromised in \nthe  Title No \056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056\056 \050 registered under the Land Act 2012 \051 in \nconsideration do hereby consent to the Rural Electrification and Renewable Energy Corporation laying or erecting an electric supply line on my said piece of land and from time to time entering upon and having access to my said piece of land for purposes of constructing laying \054 maintaining \054 using \054 removing and replacing the electric supply line substantially on the alignment is shown on the Site Plan\056 \n\nBy consent to the above \054 Rural Electrification And Renewable Energy Corporation also undertakes to favorably consider me for inclusion in the project currently being installed or any other future projects as per my load requirements\056 \n\nI undertake not to interfere or permit any interference with the electric supply line nor to construct any structure\050s\051 or building\050s\051\054 plant trees \054 excavate\057 quarry or dump solids or waste material \054 light fires beneath the electric supply line or transformer \056 next to pylons \057poles or their immediate vicinity \n\nI undertake that this consent shall be irrevocable\056)
     /K [ 3 ]
     /P 227 0 R
     /Pg 220 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

